.TH KAPTAN-MECIT 6 "October 2026" "1.0.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
kaptan-mecit \- top-down retro football game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kaptan-mecit
.SH DESCRIPTION
Kaptan Mecit is a top-down, pixel-art football game. Use the arrow keys
(or WASD) to run, X to pass, Z or Space to shoot, P to pause and F11 to
toggle full screen. When the opponent has the ball, X selects the nearest
player and Z performs a slide tackle.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/share/kaptan-mecit
stores the league career and settings.
